---
kind: lore
id: brann
title: Captain Brannoch
---

/* Brann's talk ladder. His everyday line moves with the run count; the story
   beats outrank it when their moment comes. */

<beat id="oath" on="talk" target="npc.brann" title="The captain's terms" priority="40" once="user">
  @brann{emotion="grim"}: Sit. No, sit. I've dragged four bodies out of that water this year and you're the only one that argued.
  @brann: I don't know what you are, boy. I know what I want. Come up on your own, once. Then we'll talk about the crown.
  <branch id="oathAnswer" prompt="Brann waits.">
    <choice id="swear" label="\"I'll come up on my own.\"">
      @ilo: I'll come up on my own.
      @brann{emotion="wry"}: Everyone swears that. Go on, then.
      ::set{user.bond.brann += 1}
      ::accept{quest="brannOath"}
    </choice>
    <choice id="shrug" label="Say nothing">
      @brann: Suit yourself. The rope's there when you want it.
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<beat id="regentTold" on="talk" target="npc.brann" title="Telling Brann" priority="50" once="user" after="visited('hub.regentFell')" when="holds(felled(regent)) && !holds(told(brann, regent))">
  @ilo: The Regent is dead. I killed it.
  @brann{emotion="surprised"}: ...Say that again, slower.
  @ilo: It came apart in the current. It said the crown would drown me slower than the sea did.
  @brann{emotion="grim"}: Your father wore it eleven years. It drowned him in nine.
  ::assert{told(brann, regent)}
  ::set{user.bond.brann += 1}
</beat>

<beat id="early" on="talk" target="npc.brann" title="Brann, early days" priority="10" once="false" when="user.runs <= 2">
  @brann: Eat something. Then go down and die less.
</beat>

<beat id="middling" on="talk" target="npc.brann" title="Brann, getting used to it" priority="10" once="false" when="user.runs >= 3 && user.runs <= 5">
  @brann{emotion="wry"}: {{user.runs}} dives. The crew has a betting pool on you. I'm not in it. Yet.
</beat>

<beat id="veteranTalk" on="talk" target="npc.brann" title="Brann, an old hand" priority="10" once="false" when="@veteran">
  @brann: You go over that rail like a man going to work. I don't like it, and I can't stop you.
</beat>
